#. knowledgeDossiers.0.late-bell-seven.title
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:215
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.late-bell-seven.title"
msgid "The late-bell case: why did punctual students hear it?"
msgstr "The late-bell case: why did punctual students hear it?"

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.late-bell-seven.lead
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:216
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.late-bell-seven.lead"
msgid ""
"The same bell has different times in equipment logs, roll sheets, an extra "
"edition, and local closures. Akyuu declines to choose the most obedient "
"yesterday."
msgstr ""
"The same bell has different times in equipment logs, roll sheets, an extra "
"edition, and local closures. Akyuu declines to choose the most obedient "
"yesterday."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.late-bell-seven.tension
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:217
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.late-bell-seven.tension"
msgid ""
"Keine's roll marks seven punctual; Aya's extra was typeset nine minutes "
"before the bell; Nitori's tower insists it executed one correct instruction."
msgstr ""
"Keine's roll marks seven punctual; Aya's extra was typeset nine minutes "
"before the bell; Nitori's tower insists it executed one correct instruction."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.late-bell-seven.records.0.official-case.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:226
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.late-bell-seven.records.0.official-case.5"
msgid "The Incident Desk accepts this as the case's beginning, not the story's ending."
msgstr "The Incident Desk accepts this as the case's beginning, not the story's ending."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.late-bell-seven.records.1.tower-log.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:227
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.late-bell-seven.records.1.tower-log.5"
msgid "The equipment time is stable; half the firmware-version field is under kappa tape."
msgstr "The equipment time is stable; half the firmware-version field is under kappa tape."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.late-bell-seven.records.2.roll-page.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:228
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.late-bell-seven.records.2.roll-page.5"
msgid "Keine crossed out “late” twice; the second ink dried first."
msgstr "Keine crossed out “late” twice; the second ink dried first."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.late-bell-seven.records.3.extra-edition.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:229
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.late-bell-seven.records.3.extra-edition.5"
msgid "The headline did not miss the bell; the bell missed deadline."
msgstr "The headline did not miss the bell; the bell missed deadline."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.late-bell-seven.records.4.airspace-rule.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:230
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.late-bell-seven.records.4.airspace-rule.5"
msgid ""
"Airspace rules do not settle sequence; they only say who may close things "
"while everyone waits."
msgstr ""
"Airspace rules do not settle sequence; they only say who may close things "
"while everyone waits."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.late-bell-seven.records.5.airspace-bbs.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:231
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.late-bell-seven.records.5.airspace-bbs.5"
msgid ""
"Students first ask whether they may hover above the bell, not whether the "
"bell is in today."
msgstr ""
"Students first ask whether they may hover above the bell, not whether the "
"bell is in today."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.late-bell-seven.records.6.three-reports.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:232
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.late-bell-seven.records.6.three-reports.5"
msgid "The research file permits three mutually unconvinced reports to be cited together."
msgstr "The research file permits three mutually unconvinced reports to be cited together."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.flying-book-window.title
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:239
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.flying-book-window.title"
msgid "Shelf departure: four books, only one wanted to escape"
msgstr "Shelf departure: four books, only one wanted to escape"

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.flying-book-window.lead
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:240
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.flying-book-window.lead"
msgid ""
"The window log says closed, clasp telemetry says all four moved, and the "
"fourth book petitioned by turning pages not to return."
msgstr ""
"The window log says closed, clasp telemetry says all four moved, and the "
"fourth book petitioned by turning pages not to return."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.flying-book-window.tension
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:241
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.flying-book-window.tension"
msgid ""
"The library records departure, Koakuma records equipment failure, and the "
"holding accepts only “location negotiation.” Cirno's testimony is all caps."
msgstr ""
"The library records departure, Koakuma records equipment failure, and the "
"holding accepts only “location negotiation.” Cirno's testimony is all caps."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.flying-book-window.records.0.official-case.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:250
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.flying-book-window.records.0.official-case.5"
msgid "The file says “shelf departure” so no book is called a fugitive before closure."
msgstr "The file says “shelf departure” so no book is called a fugitive before closure."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.flying-book-window.records.1.margin-petition.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:251
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.flying-book-window.records.1.margin-petition.5"
msgid "The petition is in a margin: cataloguing calls it holding, governance calls it speech."
msgstr "The petition is in a margin: cataloguing calls it holding, governance calls it speech."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.flying-book-window.records.2.flying-index.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:252
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.flying-book-window.records.2.flying-index.5"
msgid "This book explains why flying books retain call numbers, and refuses to demonstrate."
msgstr "This book explains why flying books retain call numbers, and refuses to demonstrate."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.flying-book-window.records.3.library-rule.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:253
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.flying-book-window.records.3.library-rule.5"
msgid ""
"The motion debates longer full-moon reading; the book asks whether readers "
"may be renewed first."
msgstr ""
"The motion debates longer full-moon reading; the book asks whether readers "
"may be renewed first."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.flying-book-window.records.4.window-bbs.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:254
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.flying-book-window.records.4.window-bbs.5"
msgid "The librarian's notice is clear; someone at the window seats still asks nightly."
msgstr "The librarian's notice is clear; someone at the window seats still asks nightly."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.flying-book-window.records.5.grimoire-course.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:255
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.flying-book-window.records.5.grimoire-course.5"
msgid ""
"The course teaches reading and counter-reading, not how to recover a book "
"that finished its reader."
msgstr ""
"The course teaches reading and counter-reading, not how to recover a book "
"that finished its reader."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.flying-book-window.records.6.shelf-minutes.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:256
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.flying-book-window.records.6.shelf-minutes.5"
msgid "Day 129 still did not decide whether an “original location” may move itself."
msgstr "Day 129 still did not decide whether an “original location” may move itself."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.headline-yesterday.title
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:263
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.headline-yesterday.title"
msgid "Yesterday extra: why tomorrow's incident was already archived"
msgstr "Yesterday extra: why tomorrow's incident was already archived"

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.headline-yesterday.lead
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:264
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.headline-yesterday.lead"
msgid ""
"Layout cache, archive index, and valve audio each have a date, and each date "
"is reasonable when read alone."
msgstr ""
"Layout cache, archive index, and valve audio each have a date, and each date "
"is reasonable when read alone."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.headline-yesterday.tension
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:265
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.headline-yesterday.tension"
msgid ""
"Aya says the news merely arrived early; Akyuu says the chronicle was merely "
"written late. Keine asks both to version “yesterday.” Yukari cuts open the "
"date field."
msgstr ""
"Aya says the news merely arrived early; Akyuu says the chronicle was merely "
"written late. Keine asks both to version “yesterday.” Yukari cuts open the "
"date field."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.headline-yesterday.records.0.official-case.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:275
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.headline-yesterday.records.0.official-case.5"
msgid "The case says in progress; the chronicle citation already has its post-closure page."
msgstr "The case says in progress; the chronicle citation already has its post-closure page."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.headline-yesterday.records.1.layout-cache.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:276
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.headline-yesterday.records.1.layout-cache.5"
msgid "The cache proves when the headline was set, not that the incident agreed to occur then."
msgstr "The cache proves when the headline was set, not that the incident agreed to occur then."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.headline-yesterday.records.2.chronicle-index.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:277
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.headline-yesterday.records.2.chronicle-index.5"
msgid "The index page number is valid; its paper appeared only after the case opened."
msgstr "The index page number is valid; its paper appeared only after the case opened."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.headline-yesterday.records.3.reports-research.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:278
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.headline-yesterday.records.3.reports-research.5"
msgid ""
"Research records “reported first, occurred later” as an observed order, not "
"a causal finding."
msgstr ""
"Research records “reported first, occurred later” as an observed order, not "
"a causal finding."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.headline-yesterday.records.4.yesterday-assignment.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:279
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.headline-yesterday.records.4.yesterday-assignment.5"
msgid ""
"The assignment forbids choosing the more emotionally satisfying yesterday; "
"both sources stay."
msgstr ""
"The assignment forbids choosing the more emotionally satisfying yesterday; "
"both sources stay."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.headline-yesterday.records.5.red-thread-rule.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:280
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.headline-yesterday.records.5.red-thread-rule.5"
msgid "The motion decides warning size, not whether contested content should quiet down."
msgstr "The motion decides warning size, not whether contested content should quiet down."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.headline-yesterday.records.6.headline-holding.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:281
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.headline-yesterday.records.6.headline-holding.5"
msgid ""
"Its corrections appendix is always one page thicker than the text; sometimes "
"tomorrow adds it."
msgstr ""
"Its corrections appendix is always one page thicker than the text; sometimes "
"tomorrow adds it."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.fourth-lantern-loop.title
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:288
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.fourth-lantern-loop.title"
msgid "The fourth lantern: three rabbit coaches reach one bend"
msgstr "The fourth lantern: three rabbit coaches reach one bend"

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.fourth-lantern-loop.lead
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:289
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.fourth-lantern-loop.lead"
msgid ""
"Every lantern in the bamboo claims to be fourth. Tickets, moon phase, and "
"firmware disagree on whether the three coaches happened in sequence."
msgstr ""
"Every lantern in the bamboo claims to be fourth. Tickets, moon phase, and "
"firmware disagree on whether the three coaches happened in sequence."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.fourth-lantern-loop.tension
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:290
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.fourth-lantern-loop.tension"
msgid ""
"Tewi calls the loop a shortcut, Eirin repeated exposure, and Nitori a legacy "
"compatibility layer. Reisen turned the arrow back again."
msgstr ""
"Tewi calls the loop a shortcut, Eirin repeated exposure, and Nitori a legacy "
"compatibility layer. Reisen turned the arrow back again."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.fourth-lantern-loop.records.0.official-case.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:298
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.fourth-lantern-loop.records.0.official-case.5"
msgid "The file numbers three coaches separately; the bamboo swaps their numbers next day."
msgstr "The file numbers three coaches separately; the bamboo swaps their numbers next day."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.fourth-lantern-loop.records.1.firmware-stubs.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:299
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.fourth-lantern-loop.records.1.firmware-stubs.5"
msgid "Tickets have three timestamps; firmware has one “still en route” state."
msgstr "Tickets have three timestamps; firmware has one “still en route” state."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.fourth-lantern-loop.records.2.moon-log.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:300
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.fourth-lantern-loop.records.2.moon-log.5"
msgid "The lunar log has no duplicate; its recorder passed the same lantern three times."
msgstr "The lunar log has no duplicate; its recorder passed the same lantern three times."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.fourth-lantern-loop.records.3.lantern-manual.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:301
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.fourth-lantern-loop.records.3.lantern-manual.5"
msgid "Manual 3.1b begins by asking you to verify you are not reading 3.1b."
msgstr "Manual 3.1b begins by asking you to verify you are not reading 3.1b."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.fourth-lantern-loop.records.4.bamboo-bbs.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:302
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.fourth-lantern-loop.records.4.bamboo-bbs.5"
msgid ""
"Orienteering promises no identical return route this week; that notice alone "
"arrived on time."
msgstr ""
"Orienteering promises no identical return route this week; that notice alone "
"arrived on time."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.fourth-lantern-loop.records.5.clinic-route-course.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:303
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.fourth-lantern-loop.records.5.clinic-route-course.5"
msgid "Three loops add no credits, though they may add absences."
msgstr "Three loops add no credits, though they may add absences."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.fourth-lantern-loop.records.6.clinic-route-news.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:304
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.fourth-lantern-loop.records.6.clinic-route-news.5"
msgid "The low-stimulus route is open; Tewi posted an “even lower-stimulus shortcut” beside it."
msgstr "The low-stimulus route is open; Tewi posted an “even lower-stimulus shortcut” beside it."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.dorm-window-chair.title
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:311
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.dorm-window-chair.title"
msgid "The window chair: third roommate to a co-living agreement"
msgstr "The window chair: third roommate to a co-living agreement"

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.dorm-window-chair.lead
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:312
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.dorm-window-chair.lead"
msgid ""
"The housing form says two people, the night grid measures three fixed "
"positions, and scratches on the chair request a rota entry."
msgstr ""
"The housing form says two people, the night grid measures three fixed "
"positions, and scratches on the chair request a rota entry."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.dorm-window-chair.tension
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:313
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.dorm-window-chair.tension"
msgid ""
"Housing says furniture takes no bed; Yukari says boundaries need not take "
"space. An old receipt says the chair moved in before one roommate."
msgstr ""
"Housing says furniture takes no bed; Yukari says boundaries need not take "
"space. An old receipt says the chair moved in before one roommate."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.dorm-window-chair.records.0.official-case.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:322
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.dorm-window-chair.records.0.official-case.5"
msgid "The Incident Centre lists the chair as affected, not witness. The chair has appealed."
msgstr "The Incident Centre lists the chair as affected, not witness. The chair has appealed."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.dorm-window-chair.records.1.scratch-text.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:323
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.dorm-window-chair.records.1.scratch-text.5"
msgid "The scratches read as a name, or “stop putting coats on me.”"
msgstr "The scratches read as a name, or “stop putting coats on me.”"

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.dorm-window-chair.records.2.old-receipt.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:324
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.dorm-window-chair.records.2.old-receipt.5"
msgid "The receipt predates the dorm conversion; item says only “one, wooden.”"
msgstr "The receipt predates the dorm conversion; item says only “one, wooden.”"

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.dorm-window-chair.records.3.hakurei-east.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:325
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.dorm-window-chair.records.3.hakurei-east.5"
msgid "The hall calls its rain leak a natural clock; the chair calls it curtains."
msgstr "The hall calls its rain leak a natural clock; the chair calls it curtains."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.dorm-window-chair.records.4.boundary-course.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:326
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.dorm-window-chair.records.4.boundary-course.5"
msgid ""
"The course studies passage governance; this assignment asks who may pass "
"through a chair back."
msgstr ""
"The course studies passage governance; this assignment asks who may pass "
"through a chair back."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.dorm-window-chair.records.5.red-thread-rule.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:327
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.dorm-window-chair.records.5.red-thread-rule.5"
msgid ""
"The chair wants a warning its own height; council has not measured a chair's "
"reading distance."
msgstr ""
"The chair wants a warning its own height; council has not measured a chair's "
"reading distance."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.dorm-window-chair.records.6.shelf-negotiation.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:328
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.dorm-window-chair.records.6.shelf-negotiation.5"
msgid "Housing cites shelf-location negotiations as precedent for furniture speaking rights."
msgstr "Housing cites shelf-location negotiations as precedent for furniture speaking rights."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.drift-reader-77.title
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:335
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.drift-reader-77.title"
msgid "Drift Object 77: the reader frozen on one page"
msgstr "Drift Object 77: the reader frozen on one page"

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.drift-reader-77.lead
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:336
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.drift-reader-77.lead"
msgid ""
"Kourindou calls it a reading tool, Misty Lake a book, and the kappa a "
"missing cable. The character on screen says they have not been finished."
msgstr ""
"Kourindou calls it a reading tool, Misty Lake a book, and the kappa a "
"missing cable. The character on screen says they have not been finished."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.drift-reader-77.tension
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:337
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.drift-reader-77.tension"
msgid ""
"Purpose appraisal wants an operating test; preservation forbids erasing the "
"page to test it. Kogasa asks whether the object objects."
msgstr ""
"Purpose appraisal wants an operating test; preservation forbids erasing the "
"page to test it. Kogasa asks whether the object objects."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.drift-reader-77.records.0.object-file.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:346
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.drift-reader-77.records.0.object-file.5"
msgid ""
"Seventy-seven is not a count; the shelf slip refused to call the next object "
"seventy-eight."
msgstr ""
"Seventy-seven is not a count; the shelf slip refused to call the next object "
"seventy-eight."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.drift-reader-77.records.1.drift-research.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:347
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.drift-reader-77.records.1.drift-research.5"
msgid ""
"The drift index records semantic change after forgetting; it does not "
"rehabilitate manuals."
msgstr ""
"The drift index records semantic change after forgetting; it does not "
"rehabilitate manuals."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.drift-reader-77.records.2.drift-catalogue.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:348
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.drift-reader-77.records.2.drift-catalogue.5"
msgid "The holding says seventy-seven objects; its appendix already has a blank card 78."
msgstr "The holding says seventy-seven objects; its appendix already has a blank card 78."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.drift-reader-77.records.3.boundary-course.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:349
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.drift-reader-77.records.3.boundary-course.5"
msgid "Students identify the crossed boundary, then discover the charging port has one too."
msgstr "Students identify the crossed boundary, then discover the charging port has one too."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.drift-reader-77.records.4.wire-bbs.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:350
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.drift-reader-77.records.4.wire-bbs.5"
msgid ""
"A Kourindou auditor offers free cables; Appraisal first wants proof the "
"cable is not another drift object."
msgstr ""
"A Kourindou auditor offers free cables; Appraisal first wants proof the "
"cable is not another drift object."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.drift-reader-77.records.5.lost-umbrella-news.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:351
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.drift-reader-77.records.5.lost-umbrella-news.5"
msgid ""
"Lost Property says the umbrella is not lost; the umbrella says the desk is "
"what got found."
msgstr ""
"Lost Property says the umbrella is not lost; the umbrella says the desk is "
"what got found."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.drift-reader-77.records.6.appraisal-history.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:352
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.drift-reader-77.records.6.appraisal-history.5"
msgid "The chronicle keeps the opening version and why object 77 followed object seven."
msgstr "The chronicle keeps the opening version and why object 77 followed object seven."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.spellcard-six-seals.title
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:359
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.spellcard-six-seals.title"
msgid "Six-seal defence: does beautiful danmaku still leave an exit?"
msgstr "Six-seal defence: does beautiful danmaku still leave an exit?"

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.spellcard-six-seals.lead
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:360
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.spellcard-six-seals.lead"
msgid ""
"Design, sandbox, methods, public defence, and audience notes score the same "
"spell differently. The university refuses to average six seals."
msgstr ""
"Design, sandbox, methods, public defence, and audience notes score the same "
"spell differently. The university refuses to average six seals."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.spellcard-six-seals.tension
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:361
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.spellcard-six-seals.tension"
msgid ""
"Reimu asks exits, Marisa output, Aya writes the headline first, and Nitori "
"measures frame drops. All deny changing the question."
msgstr ""
"Reimu asks exits, Marisa output, Aya writes the headline first, and Nitori "
"measures frame drops. All deny changing the question."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.spellcard-six-seals.records.0.pattern.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:369
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.spellcard-six-seals.records.0.pattern.5"
msgid ""
"The design promises several gates; after wave two, gates and designer "
"disagree on “remain.”"
msgstr ""
"The design promises several gates; after wave two, gates and designer "
"disagree on “remain.”"

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.spellcard-six-seals.records.1.spellcard-research.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:370
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.spellcard-six-seals.records.1.spellcard-research.5"
msgid ""
"Research records readability, fairness, and exits separately so one pretty "
"total cannot swallow them."
msgstr ""
"Research records readability, fairness, and exits separately so one pretty "
"total cannot swallow them."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.spellcard-six-seals.records.2.spellcard-course.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:371
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.spellcard-six-seals.records.2.spellcard-course.5"
msgid "Exit design is forty percent; donation-box shapes still earn no bonus."
msgstr "Exit design is forty percent; donation-box shapes still earn no bonus."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.spellcard-six-seals.records.3.telegraph-holding.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:372
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.spellcard-six-seals.records.3.telegraph-holding.5"
msgid ""
"Forty-nine of fifty telegraphs are readable; the fiftieth says the reader "
"stands in the wrong version."
msgstr ""
"Forty-nine of fifty telegraphs are readable; the fiftieth says the reader "
"stands in the wrong version."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.spellcard-six-seals.records.4.red-thread-rule.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:373
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.spellcard-six-seals.records.4.red-thread-rule.5"
msgid "A failed defence may be kept, but danmaku effects may not cover its red-thread warning."
msgstr "A failed defence may be kept, but danmaku effects may not cover its red-thread warning."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.spellcard-six-seals.records.5.lantern-call.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:374
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.spellcard-six-seals.records.5.lantern-call.5"
msgid ""
"The call asks for low noise; the fairy choir asks whether low means volume, "
"pitch, or rank."
msgstr ""
"The call asks for low noise; the fairy choir asks whether low means volume, "
"pitch, or rank."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.spellcard-six-seals.records.6.workshop-history.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:375
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.spellcard-six-seals.records.6.workshop-history.5"
msgid "The chronicle records the first sandbox and why six seals refused one average."
msgstr "The chronicle records the first sandbox and why six seals refused one average."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.consent-five-seats.title
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:382
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.consent-five-seats.title"
msgid "Five gates of consent: who may let research begin?"
msgstr "Five gates of consent: who may let research begin?"

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.consent-five-seats.lead
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:383
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.consent-five-seats.lead"
msgid ""
"Wavelengths, mind-reading, stopped time, historical erasure, and "
"drift-object disassembly can all be done. Five seats ask whether the person "
"doing them has the right."
msgstr ""
"Wavelengths, mind-reading, stopped time, historical erasure, and "
"drift-object disassembly can all be done. Five seats ask whether the person "
"doing them has the right."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.consent-five-seats.tension
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:384
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.consent-five-seats.tension"
msgid ""
"Eirin asks for stopping rules; Satori says unwritten access is still access; "
"Keine refuses to erase the deletion receipt; Eiki rejects ownership as "
"consent; Reimu wants a field rule spoken in one breath."
msgstr ""
"Eirin asks for stopping rules; Satori says unwritten access is still access; "
"Keine refuses to erase the deletion receipt; Eiki rejects ownership as "
"consent; Reimu wants a field rule spoken in one breath."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.consent-five-seats.records.0.reisen-consent.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:400
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.consent-five-seats.records.0.reisen-consent.5"
msgid "Blinding may hide the research question; it may not hide the right to refuse."
msgstr "Blinding may hide the research question; it may not hide the right to refuse."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.consent-five-seats.records.1.satori-processing.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:401
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.consent-five-seats.records.1.satori-processing.5"
msgid "Satori retains no raw thought; Akyuu keeps a content-free slip that access occurred."
msgstr "Satori retains no raw thought; Akyuu keeps a content-free slip that access occurred."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.consent-five-seats.records.2.sakuya-control.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:402
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.consent-five-seats.records.2.sakuya-control.5"
msgid ""
"The outside clock says zero minutes; Sakuya's operation sequence has "
"seventeen lines. Nobody averages them into eight and a half."
msgstr ""
"The outside clock says zero minutes; Sakuya's operation sequence has "
"seventeen lines. Nobody averages them into eight and a half."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.consent-five-seats.records.3.keine-receipt.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:403
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.consent-five-seats.records.3.keine-receipt.5"
msgid ""
"Content may be deleted; the receipt proves only that the right was exercised "
"and retains no original text."
msgstr ""
"Content may be deleted; the receipt proves only that the right was exercised "
"and retains no original text."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.consent-five-seats.records.4.object-assent.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:404
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.consent-five-seats.records.4.object-assent.5"
msgid ""
"The salvage slip grants custody; “do not disassemble” remains an opinion the "
"ticket stub cannot swallow."
msgstr ""
"The salvage slip grants custody; “do not disassemble” remains an opinion the "
"ticket stub cannot swallow."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.consent-five-seats.records.5.ethics-history.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:405
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.consent-five-seats.records.5.ethics-history.5"
msgid "The chronicle records the five-seat opening and its first ruling: no averaging stapler."
msgstr "The chronicle records the five-seat opening and its first ruling: no averaging stapler."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.festival-six-desks.title
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:412
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.festival-six-desks.title"
msgid "Six desks, one night: how many sole main gates exist?"
msgstr "Six desks, one night: how many sole main gates exist?"

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.festival-six-desks.lead
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:413
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.festival-six-desks.lead"
msgid ""
"The same lantern festival is an exit plan at Safety, a load curve to the "
"kappa, a clinic queue at Eientei, and already open in Aya's paper. Three "
"faiths each arrive with the key to the sole main gate."
msgstr ""
"The same lantern festival is an exit plan at Safety, a load curve to the "
"kappa, a clinic queue at Eientei, and already open in Aya's paper. Three "
"faiths each arrive with the key to the sole main gate."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.festival-six-desks.tension
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:414
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.festival-six-desks.tension"
msgid ""
"Reimu wants the stop rule in one breath; Nitori wants to know whether Kanako "
"will turn the backup supply into an offering; Eirin treats the full moon as "
"a medical condition; Aya calls publishing nine minutes early punctual "
"delivery."
msgstr ""
"Reimu wants the stop rule in one breath; Nitori wants to know whether Kanako "
"will turn the backup supply into an offering; Eirin treats the full moon as "
"a medical condition; Aya calls publishing nine minutes early punctual "
"delivery."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.festival-six-desks.records.0.festival-brief.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:430
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.festival-six-desks.records.0.festival-brief.5"
msgid ""
"The call says non-aggressive light danmaku; Safety attaches a sheet asking "
"whether the danmaku knows that."
msgstr ""
"The call says non-aggressive light danmaku; Safety attaches a sheet asking "
"whether the danmaku knows that."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.festival-six-desks.records.1.six-desk-sheet.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:431
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.festival-six-desks.records.1.six-desk-sheet.5"
msgid ""
"The faith desk does not vote on who is more sole; it schedules three opening "
"addresses for the same minute so the dispute begins on time."
msgstr ""
"The faith desk does not vote on who is more sole; it schedules three opening "
"addresses for the same minute so the dispute begins on time."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.festival-six-desks.records.2.procession-line.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:432
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.festival-six-desks.records.2.procession-line.5"
msgid ""
"The route has one entrance, three arrows marked main gate, and one ground "
"line for non-fliers that brooms keep using as a shortcut."
msgstr ""
"The route has one entrance, three arrows marked main gate, and one ground "
"line for non-fliers that brooms keep using as a shortcut."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.festival-six-desks.records.3.mixed-power.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:433
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.festival-six-desks.records.3.mixed-power.5"
msgid ""
"Kappa deliver power to the lanterns; Moriya explains why they shine. During "
"an outage, each proves it was not their half."
msgstr ""
"Kappa deliver power to the lanterns; Moriya explains why they shine. During "
"an outage, each proves it was not their half."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.festival-six-desks.records.4.aya-opening.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:434
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.festival-six-desks.records.4.aya-opening.5"
msgid ""
"The extra says “opened as scheduled” nine minutes before approval; "
"Corrections adds “which schedule” nine minutes after."
msgstr ""
"The extra says “opened as scheduled” nine minutes before approval; "
"Corrections adds “which schedule” nine minutes after."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.festival-six-desks.records.5.gate-claim.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:435
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.festival-six-desks.records.5.gate-claim.5"
msgid ""
"The rota changes the sole gate every twenty minutes. Yukari inserts a "
"boundary between minutes, leaving two sole gates in the same instant."
msgstr ""
"The rota changes the sole gate every twenty minutes. Yukari inserts a "
"boundary between minutes, leaving two sole gates in the same instant."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.festival-six-desks.records.6.festival-history.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:436
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.festival-six-desks.records.6.festival-history.5"
msgid ""
"The chronicle records the operations room opening and files the unresolved "
"gate objection ahead of next year's application."
msgstr ""
"The chronicle records the operations room opening and files the unresolved "
"gate objection ahead of next year's application."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.fieldwork-twenty-four-seals.title
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:443
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.fieldwork-twenty-four-seals.title"
msgid "Twenty-four field seals: which one proves you truly returned?"
msgstr "Twenty-four field seals: which one proves you truly returned?"

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.fieldwork-twenty-four-seals.lead
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:444
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.fieldwork-twenty-four-seals.lead"
msgid ""
"The Scarlet duty log, Hakugyokurou phantom roll, and Kourindou object "
"testimony may all be field sources; none can certify what another says you "
"observed."
msgstr ""
"The Scarlet duty log, Hakugyokurou phantom roll, and Kourindou object "
"testimony may all be field sources; none can certify what another says you "
"observed."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.fieldwork-twenty-four-seals.tension
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:445
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.fieldwork-twenty-four-seals.tension"
msgid ""
"Keine requires a question before departure; Sakuya's zero-minute shift voids "
"the date; after Youmu counts the phantoms, Yuyuko asks whether she was "
"included at dinner. Akyuu binds the dispute beside the seal."
msgstr ""
"Keine requires a question before departure; Sakuya's zero-minute shift voids "
"the date; after Youmu counts the phantoms, Yuyuko asks whether she was "
"included at dinner. Akyuu binds the dispute beside the seal."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.fieldwork-twenty-four-seals.records.0.scarlet-duty.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:459
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.fieldwork-twenty-four-seals.records.0.scarlet-duty.5"
msgid ""
"Sakuya's duty book has a complete sequence and no elapsed time; Patchouli "
"forbids averaging both into “roughly punctual.”"
msgstr ""
"Sakuya's duty book has a complete sequence and no elapsed time; Patchouli "
"forbids averaging both into “roughly punctual.”"

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.fieldwork-twenty-four-seals.records.1.phantom-roll.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:460
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.fieldwork-twenty-four-seals.records.1.phantom-roll.5"
msgid ""
"Youmu sorts phantoms into present, passing, being eaten, and insisting they "
"are petals; Yuyuko signs a fifth column."
msgstr ""
"Youmu sorts phantoms into present, passing, being eaten, and insisting they "
"are petals; Yuyuko signs a fifth column."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.fieldwork-twenty-four-seals.records.2.object-statement.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:461
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.fieldwork-twenty-four-seals.records.2.object-statement.5"
msgid ""
"Rinnosuke may identify a name; wear, the object's view, and an overconfident "
"price tag still dispute its use."
msgstr ""
"Rinnosuke may identify a name; wear, the object's view, and an overconfident "
"price tag still dispute its use."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.fieldwork-twenty-four-seals.records.3.unsubmitted-thought.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:462
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.fieldwork-twenty-four-seals.records.3.unsubmitted-thought.5"
msgid ""
"What Satori reads does not cease to exist because unwritten, nor become "
"research-eligible merely because she read it."
msgstr ""
"What Satori reads does not cease to exist because unwritten, nor become "
"research-eligible merely because she read it."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.fieldwork-twenty-four-seals.records.4.ghost-headcount.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:463
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.fieldwork-twenty-four-seals.records.4.ghost-headcount.5"
msgid ""
"The phantom roll gains three and loses two half-phantoms after call; "
"Corrections preserves the total and files the counting method beside it."
msgstr ""
"The phantom roll gains three and loses two half-phantoms after call; "
"Corrections preserves the total and files the counting method beside it."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.fieldwork-twenty-four-seals.records.5.fieldwork-history.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:464
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.fieldwork-twenty-four-seals.records.5.fieldwork-history.5"
msgid ""
"The chronicle links dispatch, complication, provenance, and return seal by "
"cause; it does not rewrite stamping as the field agreeing with your "
"conclusion."
msgstr ""
"The chronicle links dispatch, complication, provenance, and return seal by "
"cause; it does not rewrite stamping as the field agreeing with your "
"conclusion."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.commons-early-letter.title
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:471
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.commons-early-letter.title"
msgid "An umbrella refuses home, a ruling arrives early, and spring remains unsigned"
msgstr "An umbrella refuses home, a ruling arrives early, and spring remains unsigned"

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.commons-early-letter.lead
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:472
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.commons-early-letter.lead"
msgid ""
"One matter leaves six times across object testimony, collection form, "
"four-seat ruling, tengu version, wooden correction, and calendar. Akyuu "
"refuses to choose the convenient one."
msgstr ""
"One matter leaves six times across object testimony, collection form, "
"four-seat ruling, tengu version, wooden correction, and calendar. Akyuu "
"refuses to choose the convenient one."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.commons-early-letter.tension
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:473
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.commons-early-letter.tension"
msgid ""
"Kogasa asks about neglect, Rinnosuke about name and wear, Eiki about custody "
"and appeal; Aya asks only whether the headline can run nine minutes before "
"hearing. Keine finds the post dated in the spring Hakugyokurou rejects."
msgstr ""
"Kogasa asks about neglect, Rinnosuke about name and wear, Eiki about custody "
"and appeal; Aya asks only whether the headline can run nine minutes before "
"hearing. Keine finds the post dated in the spring Hakugyokurou rejects."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.commons-early-letter.records.0.sunny-umbrella.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:489
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.commons-early-letter.records.0.sunny-umbrella.5"
msgid ""
"The receipt proves purchase and nineteen sunny days prove neglect. Both are "
"true and ask for different destinations."
msgstr ""
"The receipt proves purchase and nineteen sunny days prove neglect. Both are "
"true and ask for different destinations."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.commons-early-letter.records.1.early-admission.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:490
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.commons-early-letter.records.1.early-admission.5"
msgid ""
"The offer precedes the application. Version two restores “conditional” from "
"the back; version one remains in Corrections."
msgstr ""
"The offer precedes the application. Version two restores “conditional” from "
"the back; version one remains in Corrections."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.commons-early-letter.records.2.spring-not-received.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:491
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.commons-early-letter.records.2.spring-not-received.5"
msgid ""
"The calendar declares spring; Hakugyokurou refuses delivery for snow, "
"leaving winter and spring timetables together."
msgstr ""
"The calendar declares spring; Hakugyokurou refuses delivery for snow, "
"leaving winter and spring timetables together."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.commons-early-letter.records.3.full-moon-mail.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:492
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.commons-early-letter.records.3.full-moon-mail.5"
msgid ""
"The full-moon class activates when the moon clears bamboo; Bunbunmaru "
"publication time cannot substitute for lunar arrival."
msgstr ""
"The full-moon class activates when the moon clears bamboo; Bunbunmaru "
"publication time cannot substitute for lunar arrival."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.commons-early-letter.records.4.same-serial-ear.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:493
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.commons-early-letter.records.4.same-serial-ear.5"
msgid ""
"Two left earbuds share a serial and receive separately. Property lists the "
"serial as lost while Post wants both as inboxes."
msgstr ""
"Two left earbuds share a serial and receive separately. Property lists the "
"serial as lost while Post wants both as inboxes."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.commons-early-letter.records.5.commons-history.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:494
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.commons-early-letter.records.5.commons-history.5"
msgid ""
"The chronicle ties object, post, and calendar with one red thread without "
"rewriting delivery order as causal order."
msgstr ""
"The chronicle ties object, post, and calendar with one red thread without "
"rewriting delivery order as causal order."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.graduation-before-enrolment.title
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:501
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.graduation-before-enrolment.title"
msgid "One degree, twelve paths, and an alumni roll nine minutes early"
msgstr "One degree, twelve paths, and an alumni roll nine minutes early"

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.graduation-before-enrolment.lead
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:502
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.graduation-before-enrolment.lead"
msgid ""
"Graduation proves eight desks saw their own fields; it does not prove "
"record, time, and graduate arrive in the same edition."
msgstr ""
"Graduation proves eight desks saw their own fields; it does not prove "
"record, time, and graduate arrive in the same edition."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.graduation-before-enrolment.tension
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:503
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.graduation-before-enrolment.tension"
msgid ""
"Keine demands traceable cores and chronology; Akyuu finds an admission "
"entered after graduation. Aya has published the alumni roll, while Yukari "
"moves the degree year to the reverse. Careers can only ask what this edition "
"of you will refuse tomorrow."
msgstr ""
"Keine demands traceable cores and chronology; Akyuu finds an admission "
"entered after graduation. Aya has published the alumni roll, while Yukari "
"moves the degree year to the reverse. Careers can only ask what this edition "
"of you will refuse tomorrow."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.graduation-before-enrolment.records.0.graduation-capstone.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:522
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.graduation-before-enrolment.records.0.graduation-capstone.5"
msgid ""
"The capstone keeps one version the graduate distrusts but may not delete; "
"the board may not average it into a prettier result."
msgstr ""
"The capstone keeps one version the graduate distrusts but may not delete; "
"the board may not average it into a prettier result."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.graduation-before-enrolment.records.1.missing-year-job.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:523
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.graduation-before-enrolment.records.1.missing-year-job.5"
msgid ""
"The role restores deleted Wednesdays but forbids recording imagined lessons "
"as observed; the vacancy lacks both a person and a day."
msgstr ""
"The role restores deleted Wednesdays but forbids recording imagined lessons "
"as observed; the vacancy lacks both a person and a day."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.graduation-before-enrolment.records.2.zero-minute-recruitment.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:524
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.graduation-before-enrolment.records.2.zero-minute-recruitment.5"
msgid ""
"The Scarlet notice puts room and board, a zero-minute night shift, and "
"stopped-time overtime on one sheet. Akyuu keeps version one; Eiki refuses to "
"treat a red circle as a ruling."
msgstr ""
"The Scarlet notice puts room and board, a zero-minute night shift, and "
"stopped-time overtime on one sheet. Akyuu keeps version one; Eiki refuses to "
"treat a red circle as a ruling."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.graduation-before-enrolment.records.3.denominator-hearing.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:525
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.graduation-before-enrolment.records.3.denominator-hearing.5"
msgid ""
"One cohort of 146 leaves more than 146 valid whereabouts: separate "
"half-phantom check-ins, dual employer claims, posthumous duty, and a route "
"refusing observation. The arithmetic is not broken; its subjects dispute the "
"counting rule."
msgstr ""
"One cohort of 146 leaves more than 146 valid whereabouts: separate "
"half-phantom check-ins, dual employer claims, posthumous duty, and a route "
"refusing observation. The arithmetic is not broken; its subjects dispute the "
"counting rule."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.graduation-before-enrolment.records.4.late-arrival-alumni.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:526
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.graduation-before-enrolment.records.4.late-arrival-alumni.5"
msgid ""
"The Higan chapter starts punctually after Higan week and still debates "
"alumni status for the deceased but not yet enrolled."
msgstr ""
"The Higan chapter starts punctually after Higan week and still debates "
"alumni status for the deceased but not yet enrolled."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.graduation-before-enrolment.records.5.early-invitation.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:527
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.graduation-before-enrolment.records.5.early-invitation.5"
msgid ""
"The offer arriving before application becomes precedent for an alumni "
"invitation arriving before graduation; correction mails the cause later "
"without withdrawing version one."
msgstr ""
"The offer arriving before application becomes precedent for an alumni "
"invitation arriving before graduation; correction mails the cause later "
"without withdrawing version one."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.graduation-before-enrolment.records.6.phantom-count.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:528
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.graduation-before-enrolment.records.6.phantom-count.5"
msgid ""
"The Hakugyokurou seal proves Youmu returned with a roll, not whether a "
"half-phantom counts as one, two, or Yuyuko's post-roll extra seat."
msgstr ""
"The Hakugyokurou seal proves Youmu returned with a roll, not whether a "
"half-phantom counts as one, two, or Yuyuko's post-roll extra seat."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.graduation-before-enrolment.records.7.graduation-history.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:529
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.graduation-before-enrolment.records.7.graduation-history.5"
msgid ""
"The chronicle dates the audit, degree, careers, and alumni records. The "
"invitation's delivery date still disagrees."
msgstr ""
"The chronicle dates the audit, degree, careers, and alumni records. The "
"invitation's delivery date still disagrees."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.first-bell-three-gates.title
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:536
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.first-bell-three-gates.title"
msgid "First Bell: three sole main gates and one recognisable way back"
msgstr "First Bell: three sole main gates and one recognisable way back"

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.first-bell-three-gates.lead
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:537
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.first-bell-three-gates.lead"
msgid ""
"One formal admission may pass through changing gates; the student still "
"confirms stop signal, detour notice, and first destination separately."
msgstr ""
"One formal admission may pass through changing gates; the student still "
"confirms stop signal, detour notice, and first destination separately."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.first-bell-three-gates.tension
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:538
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.first-bell-three-gates.tension"
msgid ""
"Yukari calls all three genuine sole main gates; Reimu recognises only this "
"side of the cord. Aya prints a total before arrival, while Akyuu refuses to "
"copy the newcomer’s name to the public board."
msgstr ""
"Yukari calls all three genuine sole main gates; Reimu recognises only this "
"side of the cord. Aya prints a total before arrival, while Akyuu refuses to "
"copy the newcomer’s name to the public board."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.first-bell-three-gates.records.0.arrival-season.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:551
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.first-bell-three-gates.records.0.arrival-season.5"
msgid ""
"Arrival Week opens files only for the formal admitted edition; a changing "
"gate does not rewrite admission conditions."
msgstr ""
"Arrival Week opens files only for the formal admitted edition; a changing "
"gate does not rewrite admission conditions."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.first-bell-three-gates.records.1.wood-bell-stop.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:552
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.first-bell-three-gates.records.1.wood-bell-stop.5"
msgid ""
"Three wooden bells separate stopping, finding the cord, and moving again; "
"nobody unable to hear it must pretend it is universal."
msgstr ""
"Three wooden bells separate stopping, finding the cord, and moving again; "
"nobody unable to hear it must pretend it is universal."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.first-bell-three-gates.records.2.tengu-correction.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:553
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.first-bell-three-gates.records.2.tengu-correction.5"
msgid ""
"Tengu post is fastest and can deliver the wrong edition first, so every "
"detour retains its original and correction trail."
msgstr ""
"Tengu post is fastest and can deliver the wrong edition first, so every "
"detour retains its original and correction trail."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.first-bell-three-gates.records.3.first-course.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:554
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.first-bell-three-gates.records.3.first-course.5"
msgid ""
"The first destination leads to course registration. Marisa still claims the "
"bell striker belongs with the enrolment equipment."
msgstr ""
"The first destination leads to course registration. Marisa still claims the "
"bell striker belongs with the enrolment equipment."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.first-bell-three-gates.records.4.arrival-notice.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:555
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.first-bell-three-gates.records.4.arrival-notice.5"
msgid ""
"Campus news may publish arrival rules and anonymous totals, never the "
"on-device name, application question, or needs."
msgstr ""
"Campus news may publish arrival rules and anonymous totals, never the "
"on-device name, application question, or needs."

#. knowledgeDossiers.0.first-bell-three-gates.records.5.first-bell-history.5
#: src/data/knowledge-graph.js:556
msgctxt "text:knowledgeDossiers.0.first-bell-three-gates.records.5.first-bell-history.5"
msgid ""
"The chronicle links file, route, way back, and bell causally; Aya’s advance "
"total remains in the margin, never mistaken for arrival."
msgstr ""
"The chronicle links file, route, way back, and bell causally; Aya’s advance "
"total remains in the margin, never mistaken for arrival."
